<title>UK: ABN Amro sets 300 mln guilder 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro sets 300 mln guilder 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABN AMRO BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT     300 MLN DFL  COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    17.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.995   PAY DATE    17.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    100.42    SPREAD	+53 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     SELL CONC  15 BP     TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.25 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
